        "TileImage": "$($repository 671746f4-eecd-417d-b0cd-1ad49e88f0c2).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47.\r\rYour destination is Santa Fortuna, Columbia. Your target, Catalina Delgado, wife of Rico Delgado,  has  been secretly helping the cartel in their relations with other cartels. If the cartel leaders were to be eliminated, Hector Delgado would be in charge. This would be a problem for the Columbian government because Catalina would be able to access everything.  If the cartels were joined, it would be harder for the government to stop them.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
